WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:01,500
If you are really that important

2
00:00:02,060 --> 00:00:03,650
Why have so many days passed?

3
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:05,330
No one is here to save you

4
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:18,560
I was really wrong. Take me with you.

5
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,120
I will listen to you on everything from now on

6
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:23,630
Remember when you took me off the sea stone

7
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:25,110
What did you say?

8
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:28,480
If you want to blame it, blame it on your incompetence

9
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:32,700
You think you've reached a high branch

10
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:34,420
Treat cruelty as decisiveness

11
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:37,740
Thinking that power is wisdom, you think you brought it with you

12
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:38,900
The collar given to you by the Chen family

13
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:40,500
The four seasons have become the masters

14
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:48,340
Not such a forest monster

15
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:50,940
Start the double warrant, push it in, let's go

16
00:00:56,640 --> 00:01:02,080
In addition, I gave them a ride and obeyed my orders.
